  "details": "## Description\n\nAfter the world loaded while my avatar was downloading/loading for the first time the quick menu wing did not show my profile properly. In its place was H6 as my name the defult loading icon for the profile icon & my profile banner being a pure white box. Looking up also revealed a seperate ui bug with my own nametag showing up diffrently in both eyes untill the avatar loaded.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nLoaded up the game for first session since new update and was using a non cached/not downloaded avatar\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1881-ac10ed3a53-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-05_00-19-40.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_e788fde6-e806-4483-b7f2-2daed9a29aa0/1/file)",
